{"body":"## Decision

Reject the current Graph / semantic Map / Seq proof as product authority.

The current UI path from `roccho-dev/ui#162` and PR `roccho-dev/ui#164` places `AtlasStage` node/edge/coordinate data directly in Graph, Map and Seq JSONL. That is a new coordinate-SVG implementation and does not use the existing preset registry.

The accepted replacement must use the already implemented preset/runtime from the final `mobile-merge(10)` source:

```text
semantic State / DecisionLog JSONL
→ View.pattern = graph/1 | map/1 | seq/1
→ existing trusted view-type registry
→ existing preset contract + projection + layout
→ existing renderer-maxgraph adapter
→ existing full interaction shell
→ existing #smap codec
```

## Exact source candidate

- external final bundle commit: `1daa001bf780053f4319e3fb20b4ea9a6e0d0442`
- tree: `59ff130fc7e20a4b5762c21fe97b417fc7a454ad`
- full bundle SHA-256: `208a70f3038896c9f0bd70b31d33244e913489caa7356e7968262ef0dc58bde6`
- 108 commits in supplied full history
- trusted presets: `map/1`, `graph/1`, `seq/1`, `chart/1`
- all three requested presets declare `surface: maxgraph`, `editable: true`
- existing UX includes pattern switch, select, drag, connect, label edit, delete, undo/redo, wheel zoom, touch pan, two-finger pinch, Source export, handoff and Proposal review/accept/reject.

## Required correction

1. Promote exact source bytes and provenance into GitHub authority without rewriting the presets.
2. Publish the existing deterministic `dist` as one carryable preset app.
3. Preserve existing view-type registry as the only allowlist.
4. Generate Graph/Map/Seq URLs only by setting `View.pattern` and semantic JSONL; no AtlasStage component, no per-view coordinates in URL generator.
5. Deploy the exact app bytes to a dedicated static host root compatible with existing absolute `/app`, `/assets`, `/help`, and `/protocol` routes.
6. Prove real maxGraph and the existing interaction controls in Chrome.
7. Mark `roccho-dev/ui#162` and PR `roccho-dev/ui#164` Graph/Map/Seq use as superseded; retain unrelated generic JSONL/A2UI work only where independently useful.
8. Integrate the bounded semantic authoring adapter tracked by `roccho-dev/ui#171` without moving accepted meaning, authority, source promotion, Carry, deployment or remote proof into UI.

## Fail-closed acceptance

### Existing preset/runtime

- current direct AtlasStage fixtures are not used for Graph/Map/Seq URLs;
- preset IDs are resolved by the exact trusted registry;
- unsupported preset rejects;
- Graph/Map/Seq projectors and maxGraph adapter are byte-bound to source authority;
- app build and representative preset tests pass;
- generated manifest advertises `map/1`, `graph/1`, `seq/1` with `surface=maxgraph`;
- real Chrome shows maxGraph and the existing toolbar/interaction surfaces;
- URL round-trip returns the exact Envelope/View pattern;
- no uploaded ZIP becomes authority; Git commit/tree remain authority.

### Semantic authoring roundtrip

- a declared maxGraph semantic gesture produces existing typed semantic Operations, not renderer state;
- the fixed two-set proof produces exactly `RemoveSelection` and `ConnectRegions(overlapsWith)`;
- no `MoveRegions`, `x`, `y`, `dx`, `dy`, SVG, maxGraph XML or renderer object enters the accepted Decision;
- candidate review occurs before append;
- reject/cancel leaves accepted DecisionLog and State hash unchanged;
- accept passes through the existing expected-parent/head and authority-aware admission boundary;
- stale candidate/head rejects without mutating accepted state;
- accepted DecisionLog reduces and recompiles the same semantic relation on a fresh page;
- raw semantic set bounds remain unchanged for a relation-only decision;
- a different deterministic layout is allowed when semantic relation and State identity remain correct;
- ambiguous or unsupported geometry fails closed instead of choosing a nearest meaning;
- renderer/UI restart cannot lose accepted meaning;
- local proof completion is not represented as source promotion, Carry, deployment, production admission or full repository PASS.

## Bounded semantic authoring proof

An external one-commit candidate above the exact source base proves one narrow interaction loop.

```text
base commit: 1daa001bf780053f4319e3fb20b4ea9a6e0d0442
proof commit: 96966210e50674bebd95b690482cc63ac4effb3f
proof tree: afecd96218a183b2f09d62f64aa37e2656d2c609
proof bundle sha256: 98810fd835f7bc78569bf650d1ccbd6b38345fe3e91fb2f3cac8bb83fa9e2b85
proof distribution sha256: 48e194a0beae44b8e1f22f69d6629055e06f2655d37b7963cc268724f4e0f852
canonical artifact digest: sha256:ab1df2a1882a808c8630c0bedef1a7301402320ebbbf50da125125ae4f4c0288
```

Observed path:

```text
map/1
+ two rectangular sibling sets
+ disjointWith
→ maxGraph moves B by dx=-153.4 / dy=20
→ local semantic candidate:
   RemoveSelection(set-topology.a.b.disjoint)
   ConnectRegions(set-topology.a.b.partial-overlap, overlapsWith)
→ no MoveRegions persisted
→ semantic-map-decision/2 append
→ State hash sha256:cb42518a904b08f51fa155bade197e1c5788ddc2f3ed4716ab0c6f52e3edd32f
→ accepted head sha256:0e4416379841ea597643d19c3ed18d5cd09c3fa64870bf1f005a3296d18ae176
→ partial-overlap recompile
→ fresh page reads the same DecisionLog and State hash
→ raw B x remains 520
```

Verification ceiling:

- deterministic artifact: 56 files / 22 directories;
- focused positive gates: 36 PASS;
- targeted negative controls: 2/2 killed;
- mutation target definitions: 69/69 uniquely matched;
- full monolithic repository verifier: not completed and not claimed.

Covered:

- `map/1`;
- two rectangular sibling sets;
- drag-end classification;
- `disjointWith → overlapsWith`;
- candidate review/accept in the local fixture;
- semantic append, reduce, deterministic recompile and fresh-page replay.

Not covered:

- arbitrary SVG paths;
- three-or-more-set exclusive zones;
- resize semantics;
- concurrent editing;
- every gesture/Operation family;
- production authority integration;
- GitHub source promotion;
- immutable Carry;
- static-host deployment;
- remote Chrome proof;
- full repository verifier PASS.

The proof advances only the bounded semantic portion of `BLOCKED_INTERACTION_PROOF`. This Issue remains open until source authority promotion, Carry, deployment and full required interaction/browser closure pass.

## Terminal states

```text
PASS_EXISTING_PRESET_MAXGRAPH_RUNTIME
BLOCKED_SOURCE_AUTHORITY_PROMOTION
BLOCKED_PRESET_BUILD
BLOCKED_CARRY
BLOCKED_STATIC_HOST
BLOCKED_INTERACTION_PROOF
HOLD_BOUNDED_SEMANTIC_AUTHORING_PROOF_ONLY
```

Refs `roccho-dev/adrs#320`, `roccho-dev/adrs#313`, `roccho-dev/adrs#312`, `roccho-dev/adrs#307`, `roccho-dev/adrs#302`, `roccho-dev/ui#162`, PR `roccho-dev/ui#164`, and `roccho-dev/ui#171`."}

